  "result": "Milestones are implemented per the spec. Type-check is clean, ESLint is clean on the touched files, and the full suite passes (74 files, 641 tests, including 24 new milestone tests).\n\nChoices I made where the spec was open:\n- Names are stored trimmed, and a blank name is rejected with a `ZodError`.\n- Milestones created in the same millisecond keep insertion order (SQLite `rowid`).\n- Moving an issue emits `issue.updated` with `changedFields: [\"milestoneId\"]`. Closing emits no per-issue events.\n- `runMigrations` adds `issues.milestone_id` to databases created before this change.\n- `seed.ts` clears milestones on reset.\n- No server actions or UI were added, since the spec only covers the service API.",
